510.htm\" title=\"春日江津游望\">春日江津游望</a>》</li>\r\n<li>《<a class=\"ih3\" href=\"/gushi/tangdai/dushenyan/1511.htm\" title=\"大酺\">大酺</a>》</li>\r\n<li>《<a class=\"ih3\" href=\"/gushi/tangdai/dushenyan/1512.htm\" title=\"晦日宴游\">晦日宴游</a>》</li>\r\n<li>《<a class=\"ih3\" href=\"/gushi/tangdai/dushenyan/1513.htm\" title=\"经行岚州\">经行岚州</a>》</li>\r\n<li>《<a class=\"ih3\" href=\"/gushi/tangdai/dushenyan/1514.htm\" title=\"都尉山亭\">都尉山亭</a>》</li>\r\n<li>《<a class=\"ih3\" href=\"/gushi/tangdai/suweidao/1515.htm\" title=\"初春行宫侍宴应制（得天字）\">初春行宫侍宴应制（得天字）</a>》</li>\r\n\r\n\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<ul id=\"fn3_5\">\r\n\t\t\t <li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/\">桃花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/6000.htm\" title=\"游子春衫已试单，桃花飞尽野梅酸。\">“游子春衫已试单，桃花飞尽野梅酸。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/\">桃花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/6001.htm\" title=\"烟开兰叶香风暖，岸夹桃花锦浪生。\">“烟开兰叶香风暖，岸夹桃花锦浪生。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/\">桃花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/6002.htm\" title=\"两岸桃花烘日出，四围高柳到天垂。一尊心事百年期。\">“两岸桃花烘日出，四围高柳到天垂。一尊心事百年期。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/\">桃花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/6003.htm\" title=\"玄都观里桃千树，花落水空流。\">“玄都观里桃千树，花落水空流。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/\">桃花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/6004.htm\" title=\"寻桃觅柳，开遍南枝未觉。\">“寻桃觅柳，开遍南枝未觉。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/\">桃花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/6005.htm\" title=\"水软橹声柔，草绿芳洲，碧桃几树隐红楼。\">“水软橹声柔，草绿芳洲，碧桃几树隐红楼。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/\">桃花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/6006.htm\" title=\"夭红过眼随荣谢，菊秀兰香自占春。\">“夭红过眼随荣谢，菊秀兰香自占春。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/\">桃花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/taohua/6007.htm\" title=\"见杨柳飞绵滚滚，对桃花醉脸醺醺。\">“见杨柳飞绵滚滚，对桃花醉脸醺醺。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6008.htm\" title=\"兴尽晚回舟，误入藕花深处。\">“兴尽晚回舟，误入藕花深处。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6009.htm\" title=\"一朵芙蕖，开过尚盈盈。\">“一朵芙蕖，开过尚盈盈。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6010.htm\" title=\"惟有绿荷红菡萏，卷舒开合任天真。\">“惟有绿荷红菡萏，卷舒开合任天真。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6011.htm\" title=\"田田初出水，菡萏念娇蕊。\">“田田初出水，菡萏念娇蕊。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6012.htm\" title=\"自是荷花开较晚，孤负东风。\">“自是荷花开较晚，孤负东风。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6013.htm\" title=\"画船撑入花深处，香泛金卮。\">“画船撑入花深处，香泛金卮。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6014.htm\" title=\"荷叶五寸荷花娇，贴波不碍画船摇；\">“荷叶五寸荷花娇，贴波不碍画船摇；”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6015.htm\" title=\"昔日芙蓉花，今成断根草。\">“昔日芙蓉花，今成断根草。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6016.htm\" title=\"微雨过，小荷翻。榴花开欲然。\">“微雨过，小荷翻。榴花开欲然。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6017.htm\" title=\"露清枕簟藕花香，恨悠扬。\">“露清枕簟藕花香，恨悠扬。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6018.htm\" title=\"东望鞭芙缥缈，寒光如注。\">“东望鞭芙缥缈，寒光如注。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6019.htm\" title=\"宁知寸心里，蓄紫复含红！\">“宁知寸心里，蓄紫复含红！”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6020.htm\" title=\"疏林红叶，芙蓉将谢，天然妆点秋屏列。\">“疏林红叶，芙蓉将谢，天然妆点秋屏列。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6021.htm\" title=\"湘女归魂，佩环玉冷无声，凝情谁诉。\">“湘女归魂，佩环玉冷无声，凝情谁诉。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6022.htm\" title=\"青春花姊不同时。凄凉生较迟。\">“青春花姊不同时。凄凉生较迟。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6023.htm\" title=\"我来一长叹，知是东溪莲。\">“我来一长叹，知是东溪莲。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6024.htm\" title=\"夕阳倒影射疏林，江边一带芙蓉老。\">“夕阳倒影射疏林，江边一带芙蓉老。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6025.htm\" title=\"波面澄霞，兰艇采香去。\">“波面澄霞，兰艇采香去。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6026.htm\" title=\"莲渚收香，兰皋浮爽，凉思顿欺班扇。\">“莲渚收香，兰皋浮爽，凉思顿欺班扇。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6027.htm\" title=\"当轩对尊酒，四面芙蓉开。\">“当轩对尊酒，四面芙蓉开。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6028.htm\" title=\"素手把芙蓉，虚步蹑太清。\">“素手把芙蓉，虚步蹑太清。”</a></li>\r\n<li>&#160;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/\">荷花</a>〗&#160;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/hehua/6029.htm\" title=\"拥红妆，翻翠盖，花影暗南浦。\">“拥红妆，翻翠盖，花影暗南浦。”</a></li>\r\n\r\n\t\t</ul>\t